<title>GERMANY: TABLE-Adidas H1 group net profit jumps.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Adidas H1 group net profit jumps.</headline>
<dateline>HERZOGENAURACH, Germany 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   238     vs 184</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		   294     vs 208</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share		 5.24    vs 4.06 marks</p>
<p>    Group net sales			    3,140   vs 2,240</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German sportswear and equipment group is Adidas AG.</p>
</text>
